box86-16k (0.3.8+git20260807.0579f8b+16k2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Port Box64 non-4K ELF32 loader handling to Box86.
  * Handle i386 4K mprotect requests on larger host pages.
  * Build on Raspberry Pi 5 using Box86's existing RPI4ARM64 ARMv8-A/armhf profile.
  * Add 16K synthetic ELF and Steam regression tests.
  * Drop the unnecessary custom RPI5ARM64 CMake patch after validating that the
    existing ARMv8-A profile is compatible with Cortex-A76 and avoids patch drift.

